    "description": "Perched in one of SF\u2019s most coveted neighborhoods, this immaculate Noe Valley condo blends sleek design with everyday comfort\u2014and those stunning downtown views are just the start.  This spacious, semi-detached 2BD/3BA home lives large with soaring ceilings, natural light, and a floor plan made for entertaining. The main level features open living/dining, hardwood floors, a fireplace, full bath, and a remodeled chef\u2019s kitchen with high-end appliances and a showstopping stainless steel waterfall-edge counter.  Upstairs, the luxe primary suite boasts a spa-like bath and custom closets, while the second bedroom makes a perfect guest space or home office. A second full bath, laundry room, and bonus storage complete the level.  Enjoy private balconies with skyline views, secured garage parking, and massive private storage in this quiet corner unit in a well-maintained 2-unit building\u2014just steps from Noe\u2019s best shops, caf\u00e9s, and charm."
  },
